{{Short description|Opening matchday of the 2026 AFA World Cup}}

The '''opening matchday of the 2026 AFA World Cup''' was played on 15 June 2026 across venues in [[Balisca]] and [[Sanrobonia]]. The day featured six group-stage fixtures and produced 11 goals, including an upset win for [[Zong national football team|Zong]], a late winner for [[Hersatia national football team|Hersatia]], and the tournament's first goalless draw.

