== Match report ==

=== Balisca 0–1 Zong ===
Zong opened the tournament with the day's biggest surprise, striking after just two minutes through Player A. [[Balisca national football team|Balisca]] pushed forward for long stretches and controlled much of the play, but Zong defended compactly and held on for a famous opening-day win in [[Castejón]].

=== Volisania 3–0 Mercia ===
[[Volisania national football team|Volisania]] were the most convincing side of the day, taking the lead early through Player A before extending their advantage with second-half goals from Player B and Player C. [[Mercia national football team|Mercia]] struggled to create clear chances, and Volisania's superiority was never in doubt in [[Macao]].

=== Ayorin 0–1 Hersatia ===
The match between [[Ayorin national football team|Ayorin]] and [[Hersatia national football team|Hersatia]] looked destined to end goalless until stoppage time, when Player A scored in the 93rd minute to settle the contest. Ayorin had spent much of the second half probing for a breakthrough, but Hersatia's late strike completed a dramatic escape in [[Alessandria]].

=== Sanrobonia 1–2 Galwa ===
[[Sanrobonia national football team|Sanrobonia]] and [[Galwa national football team|Galwa]] produced one of the liveliest matches of the day. Galwa led through Player A, Sanrobonia quickly replied through their own Player A, and Player B restored Galwa's advantage midway through the second half to decide the match in [[Martapura]].

=== Okaiken 2–1 Bayan ===
[[Okaiken national football team|Okaiken]] took control early in [[Axarquía]], with Kenzo Sato opening the scoring in the 29th minute. [[Bayan national football team|Bayan]] equalised through Player A before halftime, but Nobu Matsui struck in the 61st minute to restore Okaiken's lead and secure all three points.

=== Balboa 0–0 Tondano ===
The day's final fixture ended level, as [[Balboa national football team|Balboa]] and [[Tondano national football team|Tondano]] shared a cautious goalless draw in [[Concepción]]. Balboa had the better of possession for long spells, but Tondano's defensive structure kept the hosts' attack at bay.

== Summary ==

The first matchday produced an early upset, a late winner, a comfortable favourite's victory, and the tournament's first clean sheet draw. Zong, Volisania, Hersatia, Galwa, and Okaiken all began the campaign with victories, while Balboa and Tondano left the opening round with a point apiece.

